<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Lesson 11 | Facial Volume Harmony</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --fvh-bg: #f7f2ed;
      --fvh-paper: rgba(255, 252, 248, 0.80);
      --fvh-ink: #4a4039;
      --fvh-muted: #7b6c61;
      --fvh-accent: #d7b59c;
      --fvh-accent-dark: #b88e73;
      --fvh-line: rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.13);
      --fvh-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.12);
      --fvh-radius-lg: 34px;
      --fvh-radius-md: 24px;
      --font-display: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
      --font-body: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      min-height: 100%;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      background: var(--fvh-bg);
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100%;
      color: var(--fvh-ink);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(215, 181, 156, 0.22), transparent 32rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 18%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72), transparent 24rem),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f2ed 0%, #fbf8f4 48%, #f3ebe3 100%);
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.018) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 56px 56px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black, transparent 80%);
    }

    .lesson-shell {
      width: min(100%, 1120px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 42px);
    }

    .lesson-card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--fvh-line);
      border-radius: var(--fvh-radius-lg);
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 252, 248, 0.94), rgba(246, 239, 232, 0.76)),
        var(--fvh-paper);
      box-shadow: var(--fvh-shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    .lesson-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      height: 9px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #cfa98f, #ead4c2, #cfa98f);
    }

    .lesson-inner {
      padding: clamp(30px, 6vw, 72px);
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .lesson-header {
      margin-bottom: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--fvh-accent-dark);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      line-height: 1;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 34px;
      height: 1px;
      background: currentColor;
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 7vw, 5.3rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      line-height: 0.95;
      color: var(--fvh-ink);
    }

    .intro-rule {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      margin: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px) 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.18), transparent);
    }

    .lesson-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .lesson-content p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--fvh-ink);
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.075rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    }

    .lesson-content p.lead {
      color: #3f3731;
      font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.9vw, 1.22rem);
      line-height: 1.82;
    }

    .soft-callout,
    .section {
      margin: 8px 0;
      padding: clamp(20px, 4vw, 30px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(215, 181, 156, 0.45);
      border-radius: var(--fvh-radius-md);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 252, 248, 0.86), rgba(241, 229, 218, 0.52));
      box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.055);
    }

    .section-title {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--fvh-ink);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .section-title + .section-title {
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .image-wrap {
      margin: clamp(10px, 3vw, 22px) auto;
      width: min(100%, 680px);
      padding: clamp(14px, 3vw, 24px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.11);
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: rgba(255, 252, 248, 0.82);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(74, 64, 57, 0.09);
    }

    .image-wrap img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .lesson-shell {
        padding-inline: 12px;
      }

      .lesson-card {
        border-radius: 26px;
      }

      .lesson-inner {
        padding: 28px 20px;
      }

      .image-wrap {
        padding: 10px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      .image-wrap img {
        border-radius: 16px;
      }
    }

    @media print {
      @page {
        margin: 18mm;
      }

      body {
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      body::before {
        display: none;
      }

      .lesson-shell {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .lesson-card {
        box-shadow: none;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 0;
      }

      .lesson-card::before {
        display: none;
      }

      .lesson-inner {
        padding: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="lesson-shell" aria-label="Lesson 11">
    <article class="lesson-card">
      <div class="lesson-inner">
        <header class="lesson-header">
          <p class="eyebrow">Facial Volume Harmony</p>
          <h1>Lesson 11</h1>
          <div class="intro-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>

        <section class="lesson-content">
          <section class="section">
            <p class="section-title">Technique for Supporting Upper Jaw Expansion and Releasing Tension Along Natural Lines</p>
            <p class="section-title">Technique for Activating and Supporting the Cheek Area</p>
          </section>

          
          <figure class="image-wrap">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Cheek area definition progress after consistent practice." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>

          <div class="soft-callout">
            <p>Notice the definition in the cheek area. Results after 6 months of consistent practice.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
